'''Scarf''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 700 [[coins]]{{Currency|Coin}} during the [[Thanksgiving Event 2023|2023 Thanksgiving Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
It resembles the [[Default Knife]] with an orange plaid scarf wrapped around its fuller that droops down the guard and handle.

==Trivia==
*This is one of the first Thanksgiving themed weapons to be introduced to the game.
*It uses the mesh of the [[Default Knife]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].

